+// ablateProofProduction removes the new proof production this stage adds to the
+// commit path, and nothing else. Startup proof reading, the predicate, capture
+// reuse, typed state persistence, every fence, Begin/End/ACK and recovery are
+// untouched, so a run on this binary still proves and publishes exactly what the
+// frozen candidate does; it simply leaves no sidecar behind for the next run.
+//
+// This file exists only in the diagnostic ablation tree
